r.",[17]="It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.",[18]="It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.",[21]="It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.",[22]="It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.",[23]="It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.",[24]="This Pokémon is full of life energy. It continually sheds its skin and grows steadily larger.",[25]="Dratini continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels.",[26]="Dratini continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels.",[27]="It grows by molting repeatedly. Boots made from the tanned cast-off skin are a super luxury item.",[28]="After a 10-hour struggle, a fisherman was able to pull one up and confirm its existence.",[29]="It’s still weak, so it lurks on the floor of bodies of water, eating whatever food sinks down and living a quiet life.",[30]="It sheds its skin, almost on a daily basis, and grows larger. Its skin is soft just after it’s been shed.",[31]="Long thought to be a myth, this Pokémon’s existence was only recently confirmed by a fisherman who caught one.",[32]="Long thought to be a myth, this Pokémon’s existence was only recently confirmed by a fisherman who caught one.",[33]="Dratini dwells near bodies of rapidly flowing water, such as the plunge pools of waterfalls. As it grows, Dratini will shed its skin many times.",[34]="This Pokémon was long considered to be no more than a myth. The small lump on a Dratini’s forehead is actually a horn that’s still coming in."},es={[23]="Se le llama el Pokémon Espejismo porque son muy pocos los que lo han visto. Se encontró su muda.",[24]="Este Pokémon está lleno de vida. Muda su piel continuamente y crece cada vez más.",[25]="Dratini muda y se despoja de la vieja piel continuamente. Es algo que necesita hacer porque la energía que tiene en su interior no para de alcanzar niveles incontrolables.",[26]="Dratini muda y se despoja de la vieja piel continuamente. Es algo que necesita hacer porque la energía que tiene en su interior no para de alcanzar niveles incontrolables.",[27]="Cada vez que muda la piel, se hace más grande. Las botas fabricadas con la piel de Dratini son un producto de lujo.",[28]="La existencia de este Pokémon fue confirmada por un pescador que batalló durante más de diez horas hasta que consiguió apresar a uno.",[29]="Mientras todavía es débil, lleva una vida discreta oculto en el lecho marino y se alimenta de lo que cae al agua.",[30]="Crece a gran ritmo y muda la piel casi a diario. La piel nueva es muy suave al tacto.",[31]="La existencia de este mítico Pokémon fue confirmada no hace mucho por un pescador que capturó uno.",[32]="La existencia de este mítico Pokémon fue confirmada no hace mucho por un pescador que capturó uno.",[33]="Habita en orillas junto a fuertes corrientes de agua, como bajo cascadas. Muda la piel una y otra vez a medida que crece.",[34]="Durante mucho tiempo se dudó de su existencia. La pequeña protuberancia de la frente es en realidad un cuerno incipiente."},pt="Por muito tempo, este Pokémon foi considerado apenas um mito. O pequeno calombo na testa de Dratini é, na verdade, um chifre que ainda está nascendo."},evo={{s=147},{s=148,from=147,c={{t="level-up",lv=30}}},{s=149,from=148,c={{t="level-up",lv=55}}}},moves={[1]={1,35,1,43,10,86,20,97,30,21,40,82,50,63},[2]={1,35,1,43,10,86,20,97,30,21,40,82,50,63},[3]={1,35,1,43,8,86,15,239,22,82,29,21,36,97,43,219,50,200,57,63},[4]={1,35,1,43,8,86,15,239,22,82,29,21,36,97,43,219,50,200,57,63},[5]={1,35,1,43,8,86,15,239,22,82,29,21,36,97,43,219,50,200,57,63},[6]={1,35,1,43,8,86,15,239,22,82,29,21